[gd_scene load_steps=19 format=3]

; The complete playable park, composed from one canonical scene per place.
;
; This file is deliberately hand-authored. Generators may rebuild the scenes
; instanced below, but they must never rewrite this composition layer. That
; gives the Godot editor a stable place for hand positioning, local overrides,
; and new authored objects while generated assemblies continue to live beside
; them.
